  "pre": {
    "id": "GH-04-pre-q3",
    "type": "single",
    "question": "已知函数 f(x) = x^2 * sin(x)，关于其导函数 f'(x) 的表达式，下列结论中正确的是哪一个？",
    "options": [
      {
        "value": "A",
        "label": "f'(x) = 2x * cos(x)"
      },
      {
        "value": "B",
        "label": "f'(x) = 2x * sin(x) + x^2 * cos(x)"
      },
      {
        "value": "C",
        "label": "f'(x) = x^2 * cos(x) - 2x * sin(x)"
      },
      {
        "value": "D",
        "label": "f'(x) = 2x * sin(x) - x^2 * cos(x)"
      }
    ],
    "answer": [
      "B"
    ],
    "analysis": "函数 f(x) 由 u(x) = x^2 和 v(x) = sin(x) 相乘构成。根据乘积法则，f'(x) = u'(x)v(x) + u(x)v'(x)。代入可得 u'(x) = 2x，v'(x) = cos(x)，因此 f'(x) = 2x * sin(x) + x^2 * cos(x)。选项 A 错把两函数的导数直接相乘；选项 C 和 D 在符号或乘积分配上发生混淆。",
