  "post": {
    "id": "GH-04-post-q3",
    "type": "single",
    "question": "设 g(x) = e^x * cos(x)，某同学在求导时写出了四个中间步骤，其中符合乘积法则的正确结果是哪一项？",
    "options": [
      {
        "value": "A",
        "label": "g'(x) = e^x * sin(x)"
      },
      {
        "value": "B",
        "label": "g'(x) = e^x * cos(x) - e^x * sin(x)"
      },
      {
        "value": "C",
        "label": "g'(x) = e^x * cos(x) + e^x * sin(x)"
      },
      {
        "value": "D",
        "label": "g'(x) = -e^x * sin(x) + e^x * cos(x)"
      }
    ],
    "answer": [
      "B"
    ],
    "analysis": "函数 g(x) 由 u(x)=e^x 和 v(x)=cos(x) 相乘构成。根据乘积法则，g'(x)=u'(x)v(x)+u(x)v'(x)。由于(e^x)'=e^x，(cos x)'=-sin x，代入得g'(x)=e^x cos x-e^x sin x，因此选项B正确。",
